# direnv: enter the reproducible dev environment (Racket + Redex, GMP, secp256k1,
# blst, mcl, solc, foundry) automatically on `cd` into this directory.
#
# Requires direnv with nix-direnv (which caches the shell and keeps a GC root, so
# the environment is only rebuilt when the recipe below changes).
#
#   direnv allow      # authorise this file, once
#   direnv reload     # force a rebuild
#
# Without direnv, `nix develop` (or `nix-shell`) gives the same environment.

use flake

# mcl is built from source by ./mcl.nix, which the flake imports; nix-direnv only
# watches flake.nix / flake.lock on its own, so track it explicitly.
watch_file mcl.nix
